        <e k="rcr_advice_afterOilseed"   v="After an oilseed, leave three years before any oilseed returns, with a cereal then a legume as the ideal succession." />
        <e k="rcr_advice_afterRoot"      v="After a root crop, allow four years before roots come back, and follow with a cereal to rebuild structure after the late lifting." />
        <e k="rcr_advice_afterVegetable" v="After a vegetable, wait three years before repeating it, with a cereal as a clean break." />
        <e k="rcr_advice_afterForage"    v="After a grass ley, a cereal cashes in the fertility and structure built up under the sward." />
